        "statement": "Helm now accepts percentage values for podDisruptionBudget.minAvailable and podDisruptionBudget.maxAvailable, which it previously did not; an environment with a percentage set will have the value honoured in the rendered PodDisruptionBudget instead of being rejected, and environments not using percentages are unaffected.",
